  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Proposal, acceptance, execution",
      "items": [
        "Agents only reach proponer(): ea-mcp holds SoloConsulta, which does not implement Sistema, so it cannot mutate anything",
        "The stored proposal keeps tool, arguments, risk, simulation text and the precondición of the world",
        "Accepting claims the row atomically, revalidates against the precondición and then applies it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Governance points",
      "items": [
        "autorizar_mcp: claude-code gets the full catalog (mutations only propose); modelo-local gets the local projection without irreversible tools; anyone else reads only",
        "Canal::puede_confirmar: reversible from terminal or web, irreversible only from a real TTY with confirmo <id>",
        "Catalog risk: 9 lectura, 13 reversible, 1 irreversible (ea_eliminar_rutina)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Journal (diario)",
      "items": [
        "events has triggers that abort UPDATE and DELETE; a wrong event is corrected with a new one",
        "Every step leaves one: propuesta_encolada, propuesta_decidida, accion_ejecutada or accion_fallida",
        "ea-mcp also logs each invocation as mcp_* events"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Vault (bóveda)",
      "items": [
        "Only ea-boveda writes files: exclusive flock on .ea-escritor.lock, atomic write, index update and diary event inside the lock",
        "Agents write only their own region; compartida is reached by promotion that the user accepts",
        "The SQLite index is a cache and can be rebuilt from the files"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Settings (ajustes)",
      "items": [
        "The key registry marks each key as web or terminal; the web cannot edit terminal keys and only lowers caps",
        "ea ajustes establecer needs a real TTY; ea-mcp and the orchestrator cannot write settings",
        "The ea CLI and ea-web append ajustes_cambiados to the diary after each write"
      ]
    }
  ]
}